   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Home Icon\n\nAn animated home icon: the strokes draw in, then it plays its signature motion.\n\nCategory: icons. Length: 2 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A video needs a home glyph that draws itself on and then moves.\n- A crisp line icon on a UI mockup, a feature list or a callout.\n\nAvoid when:\n- A filled or photographic image is needed.\n- The icon must stay perfectly still: use a static SVG.\n\nVariables:\n- animation (enum): Animation, default \"both\"\n- loop (boolean): Loop, default false\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n- size (number, 8-1000): Size, default 48\n- color (color): Color, default \"#171717\"\n- stroke_width (number, 0.5-6): Stroke width, default 2\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
